      "orig": "Figure 1. Reading-order accuracy as the gutter threshold varies. The plateau between eighteen and thirty points is what makes a fixed threshold workable.",
      "text": "Figure 1. Reading-order accuracy as the gutter threshold varies. The plateau between eighteen and thirty points is what makes a fixed threshold workable."
