        }
      ],
      "orig": "The  two-column  decision  requires  at  least  three  lines wholly within the left half and three wholly within the right half. Material above the topmost column line is emitted first as  a  header,  and  anything  that  spans  the  gutter  below  that point is emitted last.",
      "text": "The  two-column  decision  requires  at  least  three  lines wholly within the left half and three wholly within the right half. Material above the topmost column line is emitted first as  a  header,  and  anything  that  spans  the  gutter  below  that point is emitted last."
