      ],
      "orig": "On  four  hundred  pages  drawn  from  three  proceedings,  the procedure  recovered the intended order for ninety-four percent of paragraphs. The residual failures cluster on pages with  floating  figures  that  straddle  the  gutter  and  on  pages whose columns are unbalanced.",
      "text": "On  four  hundred  pages  drawn  from  three  proceedings,  the procedure  recovered the intended order for ninety-four percent of paragraphs. The residual failures cluster on pages with  floating  figures  that  straddle  the  gutter  and  on  pages whose columns are unbalanced."
    },
